   "title": "SK hynix to expand US workforce to deepen ties with key clients",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261109/sk-hynix-to-expand-us-workforce-to-deepen-ties-with-key-clients",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
