   "published": "Mon, 09 Nov 2026 05:57:02 GMT",
   "_dt": 1794203822.0,
   "ageDays": 0.26,
   "summary": "Korean chipmaker SK hynix Inc. is preparing to expand its U.S. workforce, its parent company said Monday, in what appears to be a move to strengthen ties with major U.S. clients, including Nvidia Corp. SK hynix plans to make additional executive appointments and reorganize its U.S. operations around Dec. SK hynix had created a new executive-level post overseeing its U.S. operations and appointed Ahn Hyun, its president in charge of development, to the position.",
   "summary_zh": "SK hynix Inc.的母公司周一表示，韩国芯片制造商SK hynix Inc.正准备扩大其美国员工队伍，此举似乎是为了加强与包括Nvidia Corp.在内的美国主要客户的联系。SK hynix计划在12月前后增聘高级管理人员，并对其美国业务进行重组。SK hynix此前新设了一个负责美国业务的高管职位，并任命负责开发工作的总裁Ahn Hyun担任该职。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Korean chipmaker SK hynix Inc. is preparing to expand its U.S. workforce, its parent company said Monday, in what appears to be a move to strengthen ties with major U.S. clients, including Nvidia Corp. SK hynix plans to make additional executive appointments and reorganize its U.S. operations around Dec. 3, according to SK Group. The planned changes follow a recent executive reshuffle at SK Group, a Korean conglomerate with businesses spanning semiconductors, construction and other sectors. SK hynix had created a new executive-level post overseeing its U.S. operations and appointed Ahn Hyun, its president in charge of development, to the position. Ahn has led the development of artificial intelligence (AI) memory products, including high bandwidth memory (HBM) at SK hynix. The appointment marks a shift in the company's approach to managing its U.S. operations, which have traditionally been headed by executives with sales and marketing backgrounds. Industry sources said the move reflects changes in how HBM contracts are secured as memory chipmakers increasingly work with customers from the early stages of product development to tailor chips to their AI infrastructure. \"Companies can no longer maintain their competitiveness without working closely with customers, starting from the R&D stage,\" an industry official said, requesting anonymity",
