   "title": "PPP boycotts judiciary committee proceedings over special counsel bill",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/politics/20261109/ppp-boycotts-judiciary-committee-proceedings-over-special-counsel-bill",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "published": "Mon, 09 Nov 2026 05:57:02 GMT",
   "_dt": 1794203822.0,
   "ageDays": 0.26,
   "summary": "People Power Party (PPP) lawmakers on the National Assembly Legislation and Judiciary Committee on Monday announced a boycott of all committee proceedings, including budget reviews, in protest of the recent passage of a bill calling for a special counsel investigation into allegations of fabricated indictments against President Lee Jae Myung and others.",
   "summary_zh": "国民议会立法与司法委员会的国民力量党（PPP）议员周一宣布抵制委员会的一切审议活动，包括预算审查，以抗议近期通过一项法案，要求就针对总统李在明等人的捏造起诉指控展开特别检察官调查。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "\"The DPK pushed through the special counsel bill aimed at dropping charges against the president in just three days after forcibly ending the opposition party's filibuster through a vote. It would violate the constitutional principle of equality before the law if a special counsel were to manufacture grounds for nullifying indictments against the president, enabling him to evade legal accountability without standing trial,\" the lawmakers said. \"Now that the bill has been passed, there are few means of resistance available to us as a minority party. All we can do is resist using every means available within the parliament,\" they said, urging Lee to veto the bill at a Cabinet meeting",
