   "title": "NNPC Counters Power Minister, Says Gas Network Not Responsible for Drop in Electricity",
   "url": "https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/11/08/nnpc-counters-power-minister-says-gas-network-not-responsible-for-drop-in-electricity/",
   "domain": "thisdaylive.com",
   "source": "ThisDay（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Sun, 08 Nov 2026 02:50:39 +0000",
