   "title": "Morning Digest: Great damage done to the fabric of India by BJP, Sonia Gandhi tells The Hindu ; U.S. Representative Ro Khanna condemns Hindu nationali",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/morning-digest-on-november-7-2026/article71677130.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
   "source": "thehindu.com",
   "published": "Sat, 07 Nov 2026 07:27:48 +0530",
